#: section-%3E[0]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Why Fedora Workstation?"
msgstr "Pourquoi Fedora Workstation ?"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
msgid "Reliable"
msgstr "Fiable"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Each version is updated for 18 months, and upgrades between versions are "
"quick and easy."
msgstr ""
"Chaque version est maintenue pendant 18 mois, et les mise à jour entre "
"versions sont simple et rapide."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
#, fuzzy
msgid "Free & private"
msgstr "Gratuit & Privé"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"With Fedora, your desktop is your own. It's free, there are no ads, and your "
"data belongs to you."
msgstr ""
"Avec Fedora, votre bureau est à vous. C'est gratuit, pas de publicité, et "
"vos données vous appartiennent."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Etitle
msgid "Beautiful"
msgstr "De toute beauté"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[2]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Workstation is carefully curated to deliver a high-quality experience. The "
"desktop is clean and uncluttered."
msgstr ""
"Workstation est soigneusement choisi pour fournir une expérience de haute "
"qualité. Le bureau est propre et épuré."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Etitle
msgid "Trusted"
msgstr "De confiance"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[3]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Developed in partnership with upstream projects. Rigorously tested. Backed "
"by Red Hat."
msgstr ""
"Développé en partenariat avec les projets upstream. Rigoureusement testé. "
"Soutenu par Red Hat."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Etitle
msgid "Leading technology"
msgstr "Technologie d'avant garde"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[4]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Built on the latest technologies and enhancements that open source has to "
"offer."
msgstr ""
"Construit sur les dernières technologies et améliorations que l'open source "
"peut fournir."

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[5]-%3Etitle
msgid "Makes the most of your device"
msgstr "Obtenez le maximum de votre appareil"

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[5]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Fedora works with hardware vendors to make excellent hardware support across "
"a range of devices."
msgstr ""
"Fedora travaille avec les fournisseurs matériel pour produire un support "
"excellent sur une variété d'appareils."

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Eheader-%3EsectionTitle
msgid "Features for everyone"
msgstr "Fonctionnalités pour tous"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Etitle
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fantastic apps"
msgstr "Applications fantastique"

#: section-%3E[1]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"Browse a great collection of apps, covering everything you might need. "
"Includes exciting new open source apps as well as familiar apps from other "
"platforms."
msgstr ""
"Parcourez une grande collection d'applications, couvrant tout ce dont vous "
"pourriez avoir besoin. Inclut de nouvelles applications open source "
"passionnantes ainsi que des applications familières provenant d'autres "
"plates-formes."

